{"issues":[{"expand":"renderedFields,names,schema,operations,editmeta,changelog,versionedRepresentations","id":"18761","self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/issue/18761","key":"MC-267364","renderedFields":{"summary":null,"issuetype":null,"watches":null,"customfield_10070":null,"customfield_10061":"","created":"18/Dec/23 3:33 AM","customfield_10050":"","customfield_10051":null,"description":"<p>When being teleported into the air, a server with flying disabled will kick you for flying in survival/adventure mode.</p>\n\n<p>Steps to reproduce:</p>\n<ol>\n\t<li>Create a server with <tt>allow-flight=false</tt></li>\n\t<li>Enter the server</li>\n\t<li>Use \n<div class=\"code panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"codeContent panelContent\">\n<pre class=\"code-java\">/gamemode survival\n/setblock ~ ~-1 ~ chain_command_block{auto:1b,Command:<span class=\"code-quote\">\"teleport @p ~ ~3 ~\"</span>}\n/setblock ~ ~ ~ repeating_command_block[facing=down]{auto:1b,Command:<span class=\"code-quote\">\"teleport @p ~ 0 ~\"</span>}</pre>\n</div></div></li>\n\t<li>Wait for a few seconds<br>\n-&gt; <img class=\"emoticon\" src=\"/images/icons/emoticons/error.png\" height=\"16\" width=\"16\" align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"\" border=\"0\"> Get kicked for flying</li>\n</ol>\n\n\n<p>Expected behavior:<br>\nSince it's a command the server (via functions or command blocks) is running, the \"fly timer\" should be reset.</p>","customfield_10054":null,"fixVersions":null,"customfield_10055":null,"resolution":null,"customfield_10047":"19/May/24 4:54 PM","customfield_10048":null,"labels":null,"customfield_10049":null,"attachment":[{"self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/33715","id":"33715","filename":"MC-267364.mp4","author":{"avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/default/default-avatar.png","24x24":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/default/default-avatar.png","16x16":"https